Where the code came from: every first-party file here (helper/, include/, convert/fsdb/) was written for the WCZ
project by its authors and is not derived from another project, except for the third-party code listed below,
which is kept with its original headers under its own terms. No vendor software, headers or libraries are included,
linked or loaded: FSDB files are decoded by the code in convert/fsdb/.

This directory is the exact source of the wisp-helper binaries in the VaporView FSDB 0.1.0 VSIX files
(archi-max/wcz commit c407403cba51abafdd6c88541605d40cb8232542, no patches; build id 7cde573ac63ad956). It holds
the files the helper build compiles, plus its build scripts (Makefile, helper/build.sh), documents and checks.

Files with no SPDX line (licence texts, documents, word lists) are covered by this notice, MIT:
  LICENSE, NOTICE, helper/NOTICE, helper/README.md, helper/SOURCES.txt,
  convert/fsdb/side/proven-words.txt, convert/fsdb/side/window-safe-words.txt,
  vectors/accept/a01-min.wcz (a WCZ conformance vector made by the WCZ project's own generator from synthetic changes;
  no recorded design, no dump from any other tool)

